ua","source":"They have access to #GOLD#special talents#WHITE# and a wide range of undead abilities:","source_tag":"_t","target":"他们拥有 #GOLD# 特殊天赋#WHITE# 和一系列不死族能力："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b2418523b6012f5b803403510666e9923f70206b26af0f832ce031eae0c6c277","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5429ef645d7a7aff708f031ee3869d3bd5babca80e8887ad643cb5c49fd1fafe","logical_entry_identity":"173de5f0a3ab7415347ec1509242f1dc64a990c9878e92e61bf3cb24d72946b3","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"+Out of sight","source_tag":"_t","target":"+视野外"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e892011e17e77e0d372a0b57e8cfdb488b7daad34991b88503be1726392f273d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5430e4a339b37bb1361ebb7c1cfeefc55fb455f23487013daef8f03cf33c519e","logical_entry_identity":"d8d34e4d9b981abba34fc3259469a6ef65176afd1872bd84ed092a861e956278","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Aeryn, my love...  I fear Trelle may be right, but I will hold this bridge without resorting to betraying you.  Still, though, I will remain vigilant of approaching attacks, and prepare to strike first if a battle really does seem inevitable.  As long as I stand, no Orc will ever harm you again.  We will have a bright and shining future ahead of us, walking hand in hand into the dawn of a new, peaceful age...  and while I hope the Kruk Pride has a place there, I will not let them put this new age in jeopardy.","source_tag":"_t","target":"艾琳，我的爱人…我开始担心，特瑞尔说的可能是对的，但我会坚守这座桥，绝不会背叛你的信赖。尽管如此，我还是会对即将到来的袭击充满警惕，如果这场战争真的不可避免，我也会准备先发制人。只要我还在这里，我绝对不会让任何兽人伤害你。我们会共同开启一个光明璀璨的未来，携起手，走向一个和平的新时代的黎明……尽管我也希望克鲁克部族也能成为这样的新时代的一份子，但是，我绝不会容许他们把这样的新世界置于危险之中。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5787e884c16ef8b135c7096db244aa8a0b6c575a8ef26674b4d707faf3f8c295","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5446fc7ecaf5a226826ba08d5bf2a1118093714674b2a5058f89ba1bcd5f214c","logical_entry_identity":"b11e914f03254b1b96c6f6308620620872675618614efef377e2c35e933f7f3d","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","