round him. He effortlessly holds a longsword in each hand.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这个巨魔正朝身旁的其他巨魔高声下令，双手各自轻松地握着一柄长剑。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cf0cd48a896bc30d0f6a1c75c20f958bc573fb2cec7be96b57cf44e7997e1b80","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"54bac09664f70e4e1ba2eafcb849c11ef5c29ac12aa27c60904d9fab8179fbb2","logical_entry_identity":"20a1a0ae71b67701ea60e09c98c6c77f30c5629b81f83d64d76a2ec393528559","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Improved power output increases the speed of your projectiles by %d%%, critical damage by %d%%, and allows you to automatically reload each turn.\n\t\tIn addition, you can instantly activate this talent to gain a sudden burst of speed, moving to a tile in range %d.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"增强你的能量输出，你的抛射物速度加快 %d%%，暴击伤害增加 %d%%，你每回合会自动填弹。\n\t\t另外，你可以主动激活这一技能，获得超人的移动速度，立刻移动到 %d 码范围内的某个格子内。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b85dd0e84d2219e60ee2d2026afe802c1f7700d74085f3752caae23fc43a5b8a","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"54c5ca7d61537ccbec31fa3877be211454cab8f3b9bf66cd62d194293d29eaea","logical_entry_identity":"55a9bbd5d2bb2330f966b30a9c67092c9d81659639dcbba6f7c3a6aaaafd3bf2","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"For a Few Gold More","source_tag":"achievement name","target":"更多金币"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8dc6bb1de2253025c1f481b4f8568803c342a0e35255bb96e02cb39ea5653d6c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"54e787f081e507823dffcdbde32f5eebc898924f486002d64126c00286583f2f","logical_entry_identity":"5b214989d57e91c47f53d0ae56ff376e2329434ca5eee663dcd7e6c03ce8a2b8","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"I see...","source_tag":"_t","target":"我明白了……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a58fa4c526979164beab14c50e8b1e752e548ec60174c4ac7b4f28b153d7022d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"55193ec8378497c6b8f75398ceb5c04c19d57d0434b728c66f4310e7def837d2","logical_entry_identity":"046af7d33c347584391d9b265c3636267b288f8429e39ff03433519c22f348e2","normali